GNSS replay data attribution
============================

The replay fixture is adapted from the GEDVM Smartphone GNSS Vehicle
Manoeuvre Dataset by Yang Jiang, Yan Zhang, Zhitao Lyu, Zelin Zhou,
Hongzhou Yang, and Yang Gao:

https://github.com/YangRiverJiang/gedvm_dataset

Source revision: e2966fb40f89f009a4cc6c5282f2decdb1fe7035

The source dataset is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International:

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes made for this product fixture: a ten-minute interval was selected;
the older Android Raw record layout was expanded to the current 37-field
layout; UTC and elapsed-realtime fields were normalized; and bearing plus
accuracy fields required by the replay interface were derived.

Associated publication:

Yang Jiang et al., "Accurate Vehicle Maneuver Analysis Using Smartphone GNSS
Carrier-Phase Measurements," IEEE Transactions on Intelligent Transportation
Systems, 2025. https://doi.org/10.1109/TITS.2025.3606211
